  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Combat Trafficking, Promote Professionalisation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to consolidate achievements obtained in Ethiopia and Tanzania to promote recognition of domestic work. Specifically, and over the course of the three year project, it will seek to foster alignment of domestic laws with international conventions and bilateral agreements for migrant workers&#x2019; protection. It will develop and roll-out a nationally recognised training curriculum to standardise short term professional training</narrative>
  </description>
